{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19874","headline":"惜苦 · 孟郊","name":"惜苦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"于鹄值谏议，以球不能官。\n焦蒙值舍人，以盃不得完。\n可惜大雅旨，意此小团栾。\n名回不敢辨，心转实是难。\n不惜爲君转，转非君子观。\n转之复转之，强转谁能欢。\n哀哉虚转言，不可穷波澜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}